{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026c2FZr4Aly71793789019.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>大家樂發盈喜。</p><p></p><p>預計截至9月底止半年，純利介乎9,580萬元至約1億元，按年增加最多一倍二。</p><p></p><p>集團表示，實施各項策略性措施以來，保持業務增長動力，包括透過提供餐飲選擇及推出創新產品。店舖網絡方面，集團也整合生產力較低的店舖，調整網絡布局，並進駐具策略價值地點，加快數碼轉型及系統升級，全面優化成本。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T12:05:30.068307+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T09:47:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T12:38:32.331733+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T11:58:32.470069+00:00","content_hash":"2e54bff1ca6cad4efd93d85e2053e64051507497d60ed8393b0588149a5c103d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}